# a package built where the runtime looks for it
$ pipkg build --overlay-root <WORLD>/overlay --registry <WORLD>/refused/whole.yaml --dest-dir <WORLD>/state/pi/labdrian-pi
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
pipkg build: labdrian-pi package written to <WORLD>/state/pi/labdrian-pi
--- stderr ---

# install over: a registry that is not there
$ runtime install --target pi
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
[pi] install: unsupported — pipkg: opening registry: open <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml: no such file or directory
--- stderr ---

# status over: a registry that is not there
$ runtime status --target pi
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
[pi] status: partial — labdrian-pi status is unproven: in sync (pipkg: opening registry: open <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml: no such file or directory; compared against the worktree (overlay root is not a git repository)); listed in ~/.pi/agent/settings.json packages (not listed; run: pi install <WORLD>/state/pi/labdrian-pi); longterm-mem registered in mcp.json (not registered; run: longterm-mem register --target pi); subagent runner not proven (neither gentle-pi native subagents (>= 2.6.0) nor the legacy Pi Subagents extension is installed; run: labdrian-overlay apply --target pi); GADU.md linked at ~/.pi/agent/agents/GADU.md (missing; run: labdrian-overlay apply --target pi). 'pi --no-extensions' disables the before_agent_start contract-gate extension for that session, and 'pi --no-skills' disables skill discovery, for that session only; neither flag's use is detected at runtime (short aliases: -ne and -ns)
--- stderr ---

